/Author (Z.ai) /CreationDate (D:20260928232730+00'00') /Creator (Z.ai) /Keywords () /ModDate (D:20260928232730+00'00') /Producer (ReportLab PDF Library - \(opensource\)) 
  /Subject (The reflection-laundering theorem beyond the ring: the reversal group \(index-2 coset structure, the anti-centralizer criterion, the twist normal form, manufactured non-circulant witnesses\), the exact genericity dimension table \(the self-converse strata are measure zero\), the laundering stratification \(reflection / strong lumping / residual, the sharp converse refuted\), the binary resolution floor \(the telescoping and run-counting identities, the singleton-routing theorem, the first binary arrow at the 4-block\); and the cell's D\(2\) solved: the abelian-shadow sandwich \(the dilation identity, the lift\), the exact free-cell machinery with Lyapunov closed forms, the free scan with the empty escape room, and the line-atom reduction to a two-parameter cubic stationarity system \204 D\(2\) = 1.2771421129 as an exact algebraic point.) /Title (The Reversal Group and the Abelian Shadow \204 The Resolution Programme, Volume XI) /Trapped /False
>>
endobj
